# Files this capability OWNS in a customer workspace. init.ps1 overwrites each one
# from Templates\customer-repo\ on every run, so they must be edited in the tools repo.
# Everything else in the template is a seed: copied once, then the workspace's own.
#
# One relative path per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.

init.ps1
secrets/secrets.example.json
.claude/hooks/deny-system-edits.ps1
